<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-GERMAN LEAGUE CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GERMAN LEAGUE CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-05-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of soccer matches in the</p>
<p>German league championship played on Saturday:</p>
<p> Bayer Leverkusen	    2 Bochum		0</p>
<p> Fortuna Duesseldorf	 1 Hamburg	     1</p>
<p> 1860 Munich		   0 Werder Bremen     3</p>
<p> Freiburg			1 Karlsruhe	   1</p>
<p> Hansa Rostock		 0 Schalke	     1</p>
<p> VfB Stuttgart		 4 Arminia Bielefeld 2</p>
<p> Borussia Moenchengladbach 2 Bayern Munich     2</p>
<p> St Pauli			0 Duisburg	    2</p>
<p> Borussia Dortmund	   2 Cologne	     1</p>
